    "source_issues": [
      "Platelet unit 'cells/m3' is a typo for /mm3.",
      "Iron studies show iron deficiency, which can itself cause reactive thrombocytosis; the case points to the diagnosis only through the vague 'mutation on chromosome 9' (JAK2 lies on 9p).",
      "Bone marrow 'dysplastic megakaryocytes' fits myelodysplasia better than essential thrombocythemia.",
      "No respiratory rate is given."
    ],
